<mjml>
  <!-- global variables -->
  <mj-include path="./partials/_globals.mjml" />
  <!-- css styling -->
  <mj-include path="./partials/layout/theme.css" type="css" css-inline="inline" />
  <mj-head>
    <!-- ⬇ Don't forget to specify an email subject below! ⬇ -->
    <mj-title>
      {{ Subject .Subject .TemplateData "Welcome to PGF WatchTower (PGF WatchTower)!" }}
    </mj-title>
    <mj-include path="./partials/layout/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-include path="./partials/layout/header.mjml" />
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="background">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <h2>Hi {{ .Name }},</h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Welcome to PGF WatchTower! You're now ready to monitor and optimize your database performance with PGF WatchTower’s powerful suite of tools and analytics dashboards.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          As a new PGF WatchTower user, here are some key resources to help you get started:
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <ul style="margin:0;">
            <li><a href="https://docs.postgresfirst.com/pmm/about-PFMM">Getting Started Guide</a> - Learn how to leverage PGF WatchTower’s monitoring capabilities effectively.</li>
            <li><a href="{{ .AppUrl }}dashboards">Pre-built dashboards</a> - Explore dashboards tailored for MySQL, MongoDB, and PostgreSQL.</li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Need help? Join our <a href="https://forums.postgresfirst.com/c/percona-monitoring-and-management-pmm/pmm-3/84">Community Forum</a> to connect with fellow PGF WatchTower users and get expert support.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Thank you for choosing PGF WatchTower for your databases!
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>Best regards</strong>,
          <br />
          The Postgres1st Team
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-include path="./partials/layout/footer.mjml" />
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
